ven-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The utility of venous lactate to triage injured patients in the trauma center</article-title><source>J&#x000a0;Am Coll Surg</source><year>2000</year><volume>190</volume><fpage>656</fpage><lpage>664</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1072-7515(00)00271-4</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Lavery&#x000a0;RF, Livingston&#x000a0;DH, Tortella&#x000a0;BJ, Sambol&#x000a0;JT, Slomovitz&#x000a0;BM, Siegel&#x000a0;JH (2000) The utility of venous lactate to triage injured patients in the trauma center. J&#x000a0;Am Coll Surg 190:656&#x02013;664 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10873000</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rivers</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Nguyen</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Havstad</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ressler</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Muzzin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Knoblich</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Peterson</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Tomlanovich</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early goal-directed therapy in the treatment of severe sepsis and septic shock</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>345</volume><fpage>1368</fpage><lpage>1377</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJMoa010307</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Rivers&#x000a0;E, Nguyen&#x000a0;B, Havstad&#x000a0;S, Ressler&#x000a0;J, Muzzin&#x000a0;A, Knoblich&#x000a0;B, Peterson&#x000a0;E, Tomlanovich&#x000a0;M (2001) Early goal-directed therapy in the treatment of severe sepsis and septic shock. N Engl J Med 345:1368&#x02013;1377 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11794169<